	// FU cluster passes the 14 physical MEM boundaries because SXM/MXM own the
	// remaining two registered boundaries outside this subsystem.
	parameter integer NATIVE_SRF_COLUMNS = 16

description.text:
Logical single-port bank. A request is SERVICED on its sampling edge E0;
captured read data is published at E1. The output register does not occupy
the SRAM port, so another read or write can be serviced on E1.

Fixed-delay, full-rate relay. A launch is a valid beat, including identical
consecutive words. Each receiver local register is the final delay stage;
INTERVAL=3 adds two intermediate registers between local registers.

Effective-instruction boundary (no root register). Explicit wire families:
0: fixed VMODEL T4 raw (block T/P, output tile at bit 208);
1: fixed CModel raw (geometry-dependent, rows restricted to 0..8);
2: local API transport using CModel field locations, plus broadcast/consume.
Family 2 is NOT a new ICU encoding. Family 3 is rejected.

parameters.raw:
// One stable container carries narrow and wide formats. Current and future
	// VXM datapaths therefore keep the same physical module interface.
	parameter integer CONTAINER_WIDTH = 32
